sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OP as Operator week4 script
    participant POD as workload identity pod
    participant K8S as Kubernetes OIDC issuer
    participant KC as Keycloak requester client
    participant KCP as Keycloak authorization policy
    participant TGT as Keycloak target client
    OP->>POD: Start Week 4 validation
    POD->>K8S: Read projected service account JWT
    K8S-->>POD: Return issuer and JWKS references
    POD->>KC: Submit subject token for RFC8693 exchange
    KC->>KCP: Evaluate token exchange permission and audience
    KCP-->>KC: Decision allow for target client1
    KC->>TGT: Mint exchanged access token for target audience
    TGT-->>POD: Return exchanged token
    OP->>POD: Trigger negative audience test
    POD->>KC: Exchange request with invalid audience
    KC->>KCP: Evaluate invalid audience
    KCP-->>KC: Decision deny audience not found
    KC-->>POD: Return HTTP 400 invalid client
